      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.56,
      "end_seconds": 78.34,
      "duration_seconds": 27.78,
      "text": "Touching definitely sets it off i'd say every other day. Severe, I'd say i took the morning off to come in today and blurred vision in one eye, too as for blurred vision in one eye, it feels Severe to me oh, and a scalp that hurts to brush"
    },
    {
