      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.99,
      "end_seconds": 119.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Right, a few quick ones: shoulder stiffness, weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.47,
      "end_seconds": 123.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Nope, you know, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.59,
      "end_seconds": 127.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.45,
      "end_seconds": 132.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "No, you know, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.45,
      "end_seconds": 136.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.55,
      "end_seconds": 150.09,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "Tamsulosin. I take it 0.4 milligrams, at night for the prostate. Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day. Alendronate, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.82,
      "end_seconds": 156.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.28,
      "end_seconds": 162.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "70 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.64,
      "end_seconds": 166.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.33,
      "end_seconds": 175.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "actually, just an operation for a hernia, last spring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.96,
      "end_seconds": 180.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.75,
      "end_seconds": 184.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.63,
      "end_seconds": 203.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right, do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
