    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.58,
      "end_seconds": 212.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "so, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.34,
      "end_seconds": 217.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.28,
      "end_seconds": 222.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.58,
      "end_seconds": 226.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.6,
      "end_seconds": 230.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.92,
      "end_seconds": 255.0,
      "duration_seconds": 23.08,
      "text": "I've had an enlarged prostate, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I have diabetes, for five years. I told my wife I'd come today. I've had thin bones for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.85,
      "end_seconds": 266.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Right, so thin bones is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.12,
      "end_seconds": 274.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.33,
      "end_seconds": 286.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.21,
      "end_seconds": 296.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.37,
      "end_seconds": 316.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "okay: BP is 123 over 77, heart rate 76, temperature is 36.7 degrees. And oxygen saturation is 97 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.44,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.23,
      "end_seconds": 327.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.47,
      "end_seconds": 340.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "The temporal artery is hard, tender and has no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.47,
      "end_seconds": 374.06,
      "duration_seconds": 27.59,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight. I'm sending you for urgent blood tests because of possible giant cell arteritis. You'll be taking prednisolone, 60 milligrams, once a day, until review. That should help with possible giant cell arteritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.31,
      "end_seconds": 378.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Oh, should I take that with food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.68,
      "end_seconds": 399.84,
      "duration_seconds": 19.16,
      "text": "start the steroid today, this is to protect your sight. I'll also refer you to the rheumatology team. Keep an eye out, and if you lose vision, call us the same day or go to emergency. Right, that's the plan. Do you wanna ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.77,
      "end_seconds": 405.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hmm, alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
